elines Screenshot (1).png", "id": "3915626092078551", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499296127_3915626095411884_5364719753103044987_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=b04Pa1wvW60Q7kNvwF2rCFi&_nc_oc=AdqErXgIVoaDILFz8fVzp6vlk1UHojTLHF-BtLhZsuUe0ZOE94tpe2ZPwoag3ZTb38c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJSssfO7v10aMjNjm_iR6y3eLn39s8IcDnLoXUpAMA5DQ&oe=6AA026DA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Blade City Brand Assets Cover.png", "id": "1655153859945519", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310667_1655153863278852_7997685239185590787_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-Ghw38b_euUQ7kNvwGzCCHx&_nc_oc=Adoj6KH2ua4Ybb3_vLwUQgpJIHgSxVJQuFpTJmfQRChmgVJDuTy2xEjii8wMhiNUAnc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQL0_Utj178tJpA2fQdgxBhJ6dkc7dMKqu7U9hFGj81_eg&oe=6AA02A11"}, "display_name": "Blade City", "keywords": ["sports", "social", "sandbox", "platformer"], "long_description": "A rookie Ninja Monkey with a rusty blade, an empty wallet, and one impossible dream...to become the Master of the Blades \ud83e\udd77\n\nDodge & deflex \u2694\ufe0f in every match to win coins \ud83d\udcb0 \n\nSpend coins to upgrade blades, slay-high abilities, aura \u2728\n\nCoins also unlock mini-games across the city \ud83d\udd79\ufe0f\n\nSkate. Slice. Socialize \ud83d\udef9 \ud83c\udf54  \ud83c\udf63 \n\nGet rich\ud83d\udcb0. Get jacked \ud83d\udcaa. Throw rooftop parties \ud83c\udf89 . Flex \ud83e\udea9\n{1899581750729344}\n\n{2088024375447461}\n\nWanna help us build arena maps, blades, and expand this Ninja City? \ud83e\udd1d\ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f\n\nJoin discord.gg/playbladecity\n\n{1714375429586515}", "short_description": "Become the ultimate Ninja Monkey in Blade City! \ud83e\udd77\ud83d\udc35\nYou have a blade. Everyone else has a blade. Good luck! \u2694\ufe0f"}]}, "developer_name": "Blade Lab", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://bladecityvr.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://bladecityvr.com/terms-of-service", "publisher_name": "Blade Lab", "support_website_url": "https://discord.gg/playbladecity", "website_url": "https://bladecityvr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "821934236779161"}, {"id": "1990104051447093"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}, {"id": "2710427532541308"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "MULTI_USER", "CO_OP"], "id": "1614607460665188"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2372246093265216"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "2372246093265216"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1781905200, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2372246093265216"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1705898611536072", "version": "1.0.15"}, "id": "2403174663506544", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1614607450665189", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1705898611536072"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1788492863, "id": "1706968028095797", "version": "1.0.15a", "version_code": 192, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1614607450665189", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1705898611536072"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1788490418, "id": "1706941688098431", "version": "1.0.15a", "version_code": 191, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1614607450665189", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1705898611536072"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "2403174663506544"}]}, "change_log": "v1.0.15 \u2014 Soccer UpdateNew Arena \u2014 Soccer\n\n* Score goals, dodge the keeper, and fight for the ball in a brand-new team objective mode!\n* Available from your Watch \u2192 Arcade Mode \u2192 Soccer.\n\n\nWeekly Challenge \u2014 Disarmed\n\n* Sever 50 body parts in Chopping Mode this week.\n* Reward: EMP Orb\n* Community Credit \u2014 Huge shoutout to @ASTRAL_NC, whose original suggestion inspired EMP! Unlock it through this week's challenge.\n\n\nNew Blade \u2014 Sky blade\n\n* Take flight with a sleek, wing-shaped blade. Now in the shop in 3 colors!\n* Community Credit \u2014 Huge shoutout to @The Roaring Knight, whose winning design in our Blade Design Contest brought Sky blade to life!\n\n\nImprovements\n\n* Watch Redesign\n    * Watch panel now animates smoothly in and out, and its windows no longer overlap.\n    * New setting: wear your Watch on either wrist.\n* Redirect\n    * Redirect now springs to the nearest player instead of a random one, so it reliably finds someone to hit.\n* Accessibility\n    * Only have one controller: You can now access Watch settings from the new Menu on the lobby computer.\n* Bug Fixes\n    * Fixed an issue where performance could degrade after joining a crowded room later.\n    * Fixed a bug where the Watch's opt-in button could occasionally trigger on its own while walking around.\n* A few daily quests have also been temporarily removed while we work on improvements.", "created_date": 1788395485, "id": "1705898611536072", "version": "1.0.15", "version_code": 188, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1614607450665189", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1705898611536072"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1788392263, "id": "1705869218205678", "version": "1.0.15", "version_code": 186, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1614607450665189", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1705898611536072"}, "relea